# f2 = watch. The program of a-guard-is-asked-in-the-turn-where-a-typed-store-may-create-a-field-from-source.ir.
# testing=CheckWalkAtRunTime holds the walk against itself: where a read of a slot that may be empty goes without a look above because the state remembers that the guard of the class holds, the guard is asked
# again in front of the read, and the process ends where it does not hold. THE LIE lays the row of PutSlotOrAdd false (it ends no guard): the second version of the loop asks the guard once, in front of the loop,
# and its turn leans on that. The test built again must stand IN THE TURN: it is neither answered by the table of known answers nor carried in front of the loop: both go by the belief that it audits.
# Four tests under the name: the first version's own and the one built again behind it, the second version's in front of its loop and the one built again in its turn. Built as any other operation there are three:
# the check in the turn then hangs on the test in front of the loop and always passes.
# RUN(LEANS): walk f2 mechanisms=all testing=RowSaysLess:Operation/PutSlotOrAdd/MemberGuards
# LEANS-COUNT-2: = AreMembersUnchanged conditions=[{layout=L0 key="note"}]
# LEANS-NOT: source=WhatIsRemembered
# RUN(AGAIN): walk f2 mechanisms=all testing=RowSaysLess:Operation/PutSlotOrAdd/MemberGuards,CheckWalkAtRunTime
# AGAIN-COUNT-4: = AreMembersUnchanged conditions=[{layout=L0 key="note"}]
# RUN(INTURN): walk f2 mechanisms=all testing=RowSaysLess:Operation/PutSlotOrAdd/MemberGuards,CheckWalkAtRunTime
# INTURN: isLoopHead=true
# INTURN: isLoopHead=true
# INTURN: [[again]]: boolean @Boolean = AreMembersUnchanged conditions=[{layout=L0 key="note"}]
# INTURN-NEXT: CheckProof [[again]] checkedType=true {{*}}source=WhatIsRemembered
# INTURN-NEXT: = GetSlotOrUndefined {{*}} key="note"
# RUN(RIGHT): run-in-shell testing=CheckWalkAtRunTime
# RIGHT: 0 14 20 above tag
# RIGHT-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(BOTH): run-in-shell testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime,CheckWalkAtRunTime
# BOTH: 0 14 20 above tag
# BOTH-NEXT: exited with 0
